# "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Search your library for a land card ..." The costs of an activated ability are paid
# together (CR 602.2b, 601.2h): the {T} is paid on the Map while it is a permanent, so it is sacrificed tapped and its
# last-known information says so (CR 608.2h, 701.26a). `LeftBattlefield` reads the history in order: a tap recorded after
# the Map had gone to the graveyard would not count as the Map leaving tapped.

